%% Sequence 5: handover and payment with a fiscal receipt.
sequenceDiagram
  actor Desk as Front desk
  participant Shell as JavaFX shell
  participant Kernel
  participant Store as Storage
  participant Fiscal as Fiscal plugin
  participant Register as Cash register

  Desk->>Shell: hand over, card payment
  Shell->>Kernel: hand over order
  Kernel->>Fiscal: TransitionGuard: may go to Handed over?
  Fiscal->>Register: print receipt
  Register-->>Fiscal: fiscal sign
  Fiscal-->>Kernel: allowed
  Kernel->>Store: payment, order -> Handed over
  Kernel-->>Shell: done
  Shell-->>Desk: receipt, warranty
  Note over Kernel,Register: If the register does not answer, the guard vetoes the transition:<br/>the order stays Ready and the desk sees a clear error.
